# Agile MIS — Client Door (locked 3 Sep 2026)

Director: the **client** sees yesterday’s duty numbers only. Not SIS cameras. Not money.

## Required

1. Public page: `https://www.agilegroup-digital.co.in/client` → `api/client/gate.ts`. Not a Command Centre card.
2. Login: client work email → **Send PIN** → 6-digit PIN → **Open**. Standalone PIN (`appId: client-door`). Do **not** use `otpLoginScript`, `canLoginWithEmail`, or `/api/auth/send-pin`.
3. Email must be on that client in Master Directory (`clientEmail`, several allowed) or written when HOD/Management **Preview / Send / Add email**. Director / Sai may Send PIN on `/client` to test (HDFC sites first).
4. **Strategic clients (Apex) only**: HDFC, Canara, IDBI, Ultra Tech, AIG, Premier Energies, Harsha Toyota, Coromandel, Gemini, Zigma, KRC.
4b. Client Door books only (not Daily MIS / Master Directory): **HDFC, Canara, IDBI** club **state-wise**. Other Apex clients club as **one** book.
4c. Telangana = Hyderabad-A + Hyderabad-B (and Hi-Tech City). Andhra Pradesh = Vizag, Kakinada, Vijayawada, Nellore, Tirupati, Tada. Every state book stays visible even from Hyderabad-A. Do not filter the list to the signed-in branch.
5. Report date is **yesterday** (previous duty completed day), never today.
6. Numbers only: Sanctioned Post · Absent · OT · Deployed Strength · Vacant · Agile Visits · Last Night Check · Last Training · Guards Complaints · Clients Complaints · Incident · Late Start · Out Of Post.
7. Two pies: Sanctioned / Deployed / OT / Vacant · Sanctioned / Duty Start on time / Late start / Out of post.
8. Link mail + opened page share the same header & footer. Header: **Client Door - &lt;client Name&gt;**. Client name heading also sits below the report.
9. MIS menus (HOD + Management): **Client Door**. Management = All Branches first. The Apex list shows **every** HDFC / Canara / IDBI state book (not only the signed-in branch). Records **opened date and time**. Add / Edit / Delete emails.
10. When the client opens Client Door: record opened time, mail the report **To Client · CC HOD**.
11. Client never sees other clients, other branches, money, collection, OST, internal remarks, Control, Recruitment, Training marks.

## Check

```bash
npm run check:client-door
npm run check:mis-menu
npm run check:mgmt-all-branches
node scripts/check-recruitment-login-pin.mjs
```

## Do not

- Rewrite Command Centre / suite PIN / `otpLoginScript`
- Put Gate / Officer (Visitors) on this door
- Show non-strategic clients
- Use today’s Daily MIS as the Client Door report date
- Reopen without Director’s new numbered list
